\n危险！会摔死的！","17027":"\n\n有个好大的洞，由里面吹来阵阵的强风。要跳下去看看吗？","17028":"\n\n危险！要摔下去了！","17034":"以军神之名开启海路","17036":"\n\n由东边吹来一阵强风。海水慢慢的退了．．．","17037":"\n\n阿卡斯：“．．．我将再次醒来．．．”","17038":"\n\n　阿卡斯：“．．．力量不足的开启者．．．我要杀　了你．．．”","17039":"\n\n　阿卡斯：“开启者啊．．．成为我身体的一部份吧　．．．”","17040":"\n\n@c我是时之女神艾蕾诺亚．．．","17041":"\n\n@c．．．．．．","17042":"\n\n@c．．．开启者．．．你在这场争斗后．．．将会看到什么呢．．．","17043":"\n\n@c．．．看清事情的真相吧．．．","17052":"\n\n阿卡斯：“女神艾蕾诺亚．．．让开吧．．．”","17053":"\n\n艾蕾诺亚：“我不会让开的．．．被诅咒的人啊．．．”","17054":"\n\n艾蕾诺亚：“就算我无法再继续压制你．．．我也不会让你碰到时空之门的．．．”","17055":"\n\n　阿卡斯：“．．．！！．．．哈哈哈哈哈．．．居　然是开启者啊．．．”","17056":"\n\n　艾蕾诺亚：“糟糕！快逃啊！开启者！！”"},"excluded":[],"source_hashes":{"npc.txt":"729e18e044d5383460b74ba76ed648b7a036464b7b768a38b73f556d4c2f2fa9","msg.txt":"937a108a9e0015466dba64be6e2b45e7e28e8ca2a62c10cc9b4585bba4a8ffde"},"npcs":[{"id":"6268","type":"Event","name":"阿卡斯","source":20002,"cell":[43,7],"direction":1,"graphic":101912,"script":"EV_ijk_6268.txt","raw":["Event","阿卡斯","0","6268","0","1","1","0","20002","43","7","43","7","43","7","43","7","1","60000","1","101912","0","1","0","EV_ijk_6268.txt"],"source_line":1076,"region":"sokia_wind_tower","generated_by":null,"dialogue_owner":"sokia_wind","inline_args":"","quest_action":"east_event:6268","native_enemy":false,"invisible":false,"token":"wind:101912:1","scenery":false,"rendered_elsewhere":false,"messages":["這裡的原始對話尚待恢復。"],"harbor_owner":false},{"id":"6269","type":"Event","name":"女神艾蕾诺亚","source":20002,"cell":[44,6],"direction":5,"graphic":14561,"script":"EV_ijk_6268.txt","raw":["Event","女神艾蕾诺亚","0","6269","0","1","1","0","20002","44","6","44","6","44","6","44","6","1","60000","5","14561","0","1","0","EV_ijk_6268.txt"],"source_line":1077,"region":"sokia_wind_tower","generated_by":null,"dialogue_owner":"sokia_wind","inline_args":"","quest_action":"east_event:6269","native_enemy":false,"invisible":false,"token":"wind:14561:5","scenery":false,"rendered_elsewhere":false,"messages":["這裡的原始對話尚待恢復。"],"harbor_owner":false},{"id":"6272","type":"Event","name":"女神艾蕾诺亚","sour